夢と恋と不安で出来てる
is built with dreams, love, and worries,

19
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:49,000
でも想像もしないもの 隠れてるはず
but things you'd never imagine must be hiding there.

20
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:55,000
空に向かう木々のようにあなたを
Like trees reaching toward the sky,

21
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:59,500
まっすぐ見つめている
I am looking straight at you.

22
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:04,000
みつけたいな かなえたいな
I want to find it, I want to make it true,

23
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:08,800
信じるそれだけで 越えられないものはない
just believing is enough to overcome anything.

24
