443
00:37:43,558 --> 00:37:47,358
お星様に願い事 叶えてくれますか
Will the stars grant my wishes for me?

444
00:37:47,358 --> 00:37:50,258
地球の裏側まで 私をはこんで
Carry me to the other side of the Earth,

445
00:37:50,258 --> 00:37:53,056
一番綺麗な花を 探しに行った
and let's go search for the most beautiful flower.

446
00:37:54,056 --> 00:37:56,856
まだ君の熱い想いは想いは
Your burning passion is still,

447
00:37:56,856 --> 00:37:59,856
頬に伝う涙
tears on cheeks,

448
00:37:59,856 --> 00:38:03,556
水色は胸に包んで 届けるよ 空に
wrapped in our hearts, delivered to the sky!

449
00:38:06,056 --> 00:38:09,056
いつでも I love you. 君に Take kiss me.
I will always "I love you," when you "Take kiss me."

450
00:38:09,056 --> 00:38:12,556
忘れられないから 僕の大切なメモリー
I will never forget that because it's my precious memory.

451
00:38:12,556 --> 00:38:16,056
どら焼きは主食になれない
Dorayaki cannot be a staple food,

452
00:38:16,056 --> 00:38:19,556
ならば上書きしちゃえば 僕の思い通り
so if I just overwrite it, it's just as I want!

453
00:38:19,556 --> 00:38:22,556
夢からピピピ 覚めないで
Don't wake up from my dream with a pipipi,

454
00:38:22,556 --> 00:38:27,056
ぬくもり逃げないで まだ朝はたっぷりあるから
don't let the warmth escape, morning is still full of time,

455
00:38:27,056 --> 00:38:30,056
あと5分...
so wait 5 minutes...

456
00:38:30,056 --> 00:38:36,556
100年後続くなら 約束圧縮して！
If it lasts 100 years, let's compress our promise!

457
00:38:38,256 --> 00:38:41,256
ケーキだー！ケーキだ！
It's a cake! It's a cake!

458
00:38:41,256 --> 00:38:45,056
ケーキの ケーキの おめでとう！
Cake, cake, congratulations!

459
00:38:45,056 --> 00:38:47,056
おめでとー！
Congratulations!

460
00:38:47,056 --> 00:38:50,056
